meta {
  name: Update Notification Settings
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/notifications
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "emailNotifications": true,
    "mentorReminders": true,
    "milestoneUpdates": true,
    "resourceAnnouncements": true,
    "workspaceActivity": true
  }
}

docs {
  # Update Notification Settings
  Configure granular notification triggers for email, mentors, and milestones.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Request Body Fields
  - `emailNotifications` (boolean)
  - `mentorReminders` (boolean)
  - `milestoneUpdates` (boolean)
  - `resourceAnnouncements` (boolean)
  - `workspaceActivity` (boolean)

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Notification preferences updated.
  - `401` - Unauthorized.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Notification settings saved."
  }
  ```
}
